  13:source\asw/emFile.c **** /*******************************************************************************
  14:source\asw/emFile.c **** * File Name: main.c
  15:source\asw/emFile.c **** *
  16:source\asw/emFile.c **** * Version: 1.10
  17:source\asw/emFile.c **** *
  18:source\asw/emFile.c **** * Description:
  19:source\asw/emFile.c **** *  The example project consists of 5 simple steps. Each of the steps performs 
  20:source\asw/emFile.c **** *  single File System operation. 
  21:source\asw/emFile.c **** *  Step#1: Gets SD card name and displays it on the LCD.
  22:source\asw/emFile.c **** *  Step#2: Performs Format SD operation and displays the status of the format 
  23:source\asw/emFile.c **** *  operation execution.
  24:source\asw/emFile.c **** *  Step#3: Creates directory with the name - "Dir" and displays a status of 
  25:source\asw/emFile.c **** *  directory creation operation.
  26:source\asw/emFile.c **** *  Step#4: Creates a file - "File.txt" in the root directory and writes the 
  27:source\asw/emFile.c **** *  following string to the file -"123456789". Displays a status of operations 
  28:source\asw/emFile.c **** *  execution.
  29:source\asw/emFile.c **** *  Step#5: Copies newly created file ("File.txt") to directory "Dir" with the 
  30:source\asw/emFile.c **** *  name - "File1.txt". 
ARM GAS  C:\Users\agila\AppData\Local\Temp\ccBGDOXA.s 			page 2


